  "body": "N47L unsigned Windows development preview. Exact original CI inner ZIP, renamed without rebuilding or repacking. Explicit literal/all_terms/any_terms fact recall preserves complete recorded counter-evidence. Option-shaped queries stay literal data; default and explicit literal retain identical output bytes. The reviewed candidate passed 60 registered native groups and N47L 16 scenarios/258 assertions plus 112 CLI/MCP checks across 126 commands, with Server 2022, portable and sanitizer evidence. Separate actual subagents reviewed storage and interfaces and closed scoped findings. This release does not establish new PostgreSQL integration, live-host model consumption or provider-egress acceptance. Read MULTI-TERM-RECALL.zh-CN.md and PROVENANCE.json. ZIP SHA-256: ed44a43d79e1e76efa768e74872223cd5d867dfb92881fe67aab129789cd4408"
